en je mogoče shraniti obrazec.','Remove'=>'Odstrani','Send OTP'=>'Pošlji OTP','Wait ${bf_resend_countdown}s to Resend'=>'Počakajte ${bf_resend_countdown}s za ponovno pošiljanje','Verify OTP'=>'Preveri OTP','Mollie API key is missing'=>'Manjka Mollie API ključ','Mollie Redirect Url is not Selected'=>'Nije izbran Mollie URL za preusmeritev','PayPal Client ID is missing'=>'Manjka PayPal ID odjemalca','Razorpay Client ID is missing'=>'Manjka Razorpay ID odjemalca','Drag and drop fields here'=>'Povlecite in spustite polja sem','Stripe publishable key is missing'=>'Manjka Stripe objavljivi ključ','History Empty'=>'Zgodovina je prazna','Please select property you want to import with form'=>'Prosimo, izberite lastnost, ki jo želite uvoziti z obrazcem','Preview Form'=>'Predogled obrazca','Preview'=>'Predogled','Custom CSS/JS'=>'Prilagojeni CSS/JS','How to add Custom CSS/JS:'=>'Kako dodati prilagojeni CSS/JS:','You can write your custom CSS/JS her. This CSS/JS will be applied in this form only.'=>'Tukaj lahko napišete svoj prilagojeni CSS/JS. Ta CSS/JS bo uporabljen samo v tem obrazcu.','In order to repopulate form fields, it is necessary to store the submitted data in the database. Please make sure to turn off the "disable storing form submission data" option in the form settings.'=>'Za ponovno zapolnitev polj obrazca je potrebno shraniti poslane podatke v bazo podatkov. Prosimo, poskrbite, da je v nastavitvah obrazca izklopljena možnost »onemogoči shranjevanje podatkov oddaje obrazca«.','Form Abandonment'=>'Opustitev obrazca','How to setup Form Abandonment & save partial form progress:'=>'Kako nastaviti opustitev obrazca in shranjevanje delnega napredka:','Show warning message below the form description'=>'Prikaži opozorilno sporočilo pod opisom obrazca','Places an admin-defined message below the form description, making your users aware that their field values are being saved before submission.'=>'Pod opisom obrazca prikaže sporočilo, ki ga določi skrbnik, da uporabnike obvesti, da se vrednosti njihovih polj shranjujejo pred oddajo.','Save draft only for logged in users'=>'Shrani osnutek samo za prijavljene uporabnike','Repopulate form fields with previous partial entry'=>'Ponovno zapolni polja obrazca s prejšnjim delnim vnosom','If the user is logged in, the form will be repopulated with the previous partial entry from the database.
